    "sections": {
        "description": "The Disinfection Theme is designed for service-based websites related to cleaning companies, house cleaning services, commercial cleaning, office cleaning, janitorial businesses, maid services, and deep cleaning agencies. The layout includes sections for service details, contact information, team introductions, pricing, testimonials, and appointment inquiries. Its structure supports businesses that need a clear presentation of cleaning-related services without unnecessary design complexity. The Disinfection Theme includes responsive page layouts that adapt across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It supports customizable banners, homepage sections, navigation menus, and widget-ready areas for adding business information or service highlights. Users can manage colors, fonts, logos, and images through the customization panel without modifying code. The theme is also compatible with common plugins used for contact forms, galleries, and scheduling tools. Built with organized code and standard design practices, it allows cleaning service providers to maintain a functional website focused on service visibility and customer communication. The overall design suits businesses that require a simple and structured online presence for presenting residential or commercial cleaning operations."
    },
